<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Garovaglio Q2 net $7.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Garovaglio Q2 net $7.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to December 31. Net $7.6 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: agroindustrial firm S.A. Garovaglio &amp; Zorraquin provided neither comparatives for the second quarter nor EPS.</p>
<p>It said at December 31 net worth stood at $192.2 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
